# Legacy file — superseded by `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` and [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).

Cursor loads project rules from **`.cursor/rules/`**. Behavioral constraints (markdown, lint bar, quality) live in:

- `.cursor/rules/shared/linting.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/shared/documentation.mdc` (canonical prose lives under **`documentation/`**, not repo-root `docs/`)
- `.cursor/rules/shared/monorepo.mdc`

See also **[`.cursor/README.md`](.cursor/README.md)** for layout and how to add rules.
